          "kicker": "Preparation squeeze",
          "heading": "Sewabu says only around 10 Japan players joined White's Lyon camp",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby chief executive Kali Sewabu has said only about 10 players from the Japan match have travelled to Europe, with the rest drawn from the European-based pool. White and that group flew from Tokyo straight into a three-day camp in Lyon, and Sewabu called limited preparation time the 'normal challenge and barrier for Fiji rugby'. He said White wanted to see the whole squad before naming the final squad, a call that has since been made."
