          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "England's Alex Mitchell limps off with suspected hamstring pull before Wallabies",
          "body": "Alex Mitchell limped off Northampton's 28-14 win over Gloucester with a suspected hamstring pull, and the Guardian describes him as a major doubt for England's autumn opener against Australia. It is a fourth hamstring injury this year, and Archie McParland, his Saints team-mate and fellow scrum-half, missed the game with a calf injury sustained at England's training camp. Fin Smith, Northampton's fly-half, is already sidelined with a calf injury."
        },
