          "heading": "France's South Africa squad still open after 'fresh blow' reported 16 October",
          "body": "The last reported setback was SA Rugby Magazine's 16 October piece, headlined 'Les Bleus dealt fresh blow ahead of Bok brawl'. Nothing newer has been reported on France's squad, so the matchday list for the South Africa Test is still open, and it will only close once France name it. Until that announcement, France's group for the match cannot be confirmed from reported sources."
