          "kicker": "Coppa Italia",
          "heading": "Valorugby Emilia beat Fiamme Oro 38-31 in Coppa Italia Girone 2",
          "body": "Italian club rugby, not the Azzurri, but Valorugby Emilia moved to the top of Coppa Italia Girone 2 with a 38-31 win at Fiamme Oro in Rome on Saturday. Casilio opened the scoring and Hugo kicked six from six, as the visitors led 28-17 at half-time and held on in the second half. The result leaves Valorugby on 20 points, ahead of Fiamme Oro on 17 and Viadana on 15."
