          "kicker": "Russell interview",
          "heading": "Finn Russell talks Henry Pollock, Eddie Hearn and Scotland's All Blacks bid",
          "body": "Finn Russell has spoken to the Daily Mail about sharing the spotlight with Henry Pollock, life under Eddie Hearn and Scotland's bid to make history against the All Blacks. The backdrop is a long record: New Zealand have won 31 meetings, two have been drawn and Scotland have won none, according to BBC Scotland's Tom English. Scotland meet the All Blacks at Murrayfield on Saturday, having beaten Fiji 33-17 last time out."
