          "heading": "Santiago Carreras and Thomas Gallo ruled out of Argentina squad through injury",
          "body": "Argentina lost two first-choice players on the eve of their London camp, with Santiago Carreras (Bath) and Thomas Gallo (Lyon) ruled out by injury. Mateo Soler (Dogos) and Rodrigo Martínez (Dragons) came in, and Contepomi's side is also waiting on Santiago Chocobares (Toulouse), whose HIA outcome is pending, with Matías Moroni (Bristol Bears) on stand-by. Gallo and Carreras are both out with longterm injuries."
