          "heading": "Patrick Tuipulotu and Sam Darry omitted from All Blacks' northern squad",
          "body": "Patrick Tuipulotu and Sam Darry are both missing from the 36-man squad for New Zealand's northern leg of the Nations Championship, with Crusaders lock Jamie Hannah getting the nod ahead of them. Stephen Donald called Tuipulotu \"hugely unlucky\" on The Aftermatch with Kirst and Beav, and picked out Darry, who started two Tests in Rugby's Greatest Rivalry, as another unlucky omission. Dave Rennie's engine room options now include Scott Barrett, Josh Lord, Fabian Holland and Tupou Vaa'i."
